      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tips. i was thinking about looking at places in areas like brixton or peckham because i heard they have amazing food and a really cool vibe, but i've also heard those areas can be a bit rough around the edges or unsafe compared to places like kensington. do you think it's actually worth staying in those more diverse/immigrant-heavy areas if i'm traveling solo, or is the crime risk too high?",
